{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "今天是文化节。", "text_idx": 135, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为在家里也是闲得慌，所以我就和樱乃上街买东西了。", "text_idx": 136, "plain": "因为在家里也是闲得慌，所以我就和樱乃上街买东西了。", "plain_idx": 136, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「樱乃有什么想要的吗？」", "text_idx": 137, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「和哥在一起的时间是买不到的」", "text_idx": 139, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1042", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这话说得可真是让人高兴呢」", "text_idx": 141, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我试着扮演一个讨人喜欢的妹妹」", "text_idx": 142, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1043", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不用扮演，你本来就是」", "text_idx": 144, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「才没有」", "text_idx": 145, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1044", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她似乎并不是想寻求我的认可。", "text_idx": 147, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥有想要的东西吗？」", "text_idx": 148, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1045", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「和妹妹在一起的时间是买不到的」", "text_idx": 150, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 151, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1046", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这种时候……不应该夸我一句讨人喜欢的哥哥吗」", "text_idx": 153, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥就是哥哥」", "text_idx": 154, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1047", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，说的也是」", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来要开始一场漫无目的的橱窗购物了。", "text_idx": 157, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有没有想要的新衣服？」", "text_idx": 158, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「像你这个年纪的女生，大多会把钱花在这方面上」", "text_idx": 159, "plain": "「像你这个年纪的女生，大多会把钱花在这方面上」", "plain_idx": 159, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「乱花钱可不好」", "text_idx": 160, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1048", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你还真是节俭」", "text_idx": 162, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「比不过爱理」", "text_idx": 163, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1049", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「现在很少有像你们一样节俭的人了」", "text_idx": 165, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "行人逐渐变多了，我们牵起了手。", "text_idx": 166, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她为了防止迷路紧紧贴着我的样子，和小时候一模一样。", "text_idx": 167, "plain": "她为了防止迷路紧紧贴着我的样子，和小时候一模一样。", "plain_idx": 167, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你喜欢什么样的衣服？」", "text_idx": 168, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……最近喜欢轻翩翩的那种」", "text_idx": 169, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1050", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「轻翩翩？」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「比如安洁穿的那件」", "text_idx": 172, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1051", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，与其说是轻翩翩，不如说是轻飘飘吧」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是轻翩翩」", "text_idx": 175, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1052", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她似乎对那个字眼很执着。", "text_idx": 177, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感觉天羽学姐也很适合」", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1053", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也许吧。她很有大小姐的气质」", "text_idx": 180, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好嫉妒天羽学姐可爱的轻翩翩」", "text_idx": 181, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1054", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我们还是不要再说轻翩翩这个词了（译注：ビラビラ也可指女性生殖器）」", "text_idx": 183, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "已经两次有路人往我们这边看了。", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥哥不想看我的轻翩翩吗？」", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1055", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……」", "text_idx": 151, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我顿时不知道该说什么好了。", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「请收下这个」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0440", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "走到车站门口，耳边传来了有些熟悉的声音。", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「打扰了，请收下这个」", "text_idx": 193, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0441", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？！」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不禁怀疑自己是不是看错了。", "text_idx": 196, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那是天羽学姐吧？", "text_idx": 197, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那身打扮是……", "text_idx": 198, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「请收下这……」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0442", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她向我递来一包放有宣传单的小包纸巾，我下意识地把它收下。", "text_idx": 201, "plain": "她向我递来一包放有宣传单的小包纸巾，我下意识地把它收下。", "plain_idx": 201, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，是瓜生啊」", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0443", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「天羽学姐」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1057", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "即使和她对上了视线，我也不知道该作何反应。", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她身上长了翅膀和猫耳朵，而且这衣服很合身，让我有点不知所措。", "text_idx": 207, "plain": "她身上长了翅膀和猫耳朵，而且这衣服很合身，让我有点不知所措。", "plain_idx": 207, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「两位是要去哪里？」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0444", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，只是打算稍微买点东西」", "text_idx": 210, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「学姐是在干什么呢？」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我在做分发纸巾的兼职」", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0445", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "传单上介绍了一家车站附近的女仆咖啡厅。", "text_idx": 214, "plain": "传单上介绍了一家车站附近的女仆咖啡厅。", "plain_idx": 214, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁咖啡厅？」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1058", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「学姐是在女仆咖啡厅做兼职吗？」", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，我只负责分发纸巾～」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0446", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「女仆咖啡厅……这个肯定会很火」", "text_idx": 220, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1059", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没有，现在可以说是已经过气的东西了……」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过这还真是令人吃惊。", "text_idx": 223, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那个像天使一样的天羽学姐竟然会穿成这样做兼职……", "text_idx": 224, "plain": "那个像天使一样的天羽学姐竟然会穿成这样做兼职……", "plain_idx": 224, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过说是女仆咖啡厅，穿的却不是女仆装，难道说这是店长的个人兴趣么。", "text_idx": 225, "plain": "不过说是女仆咖啡厅，穿的却不是女仆装，难道说这是店长的个人兴趣么。", "plain_idx": 225, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥，我想要那个」", "text_idx": 226, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1060", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你指的是哪个？」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「天羽学姐的轻翩翩」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1061", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「轻翩翩？」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0447", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊！你说的是学姐穿的衣服吧！」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐的这一声“轻翩翩”把我吓得慌了神。", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但这身衣服穿起来还是挺难为情的。光是站在这里就显得很格格不入了……」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": "「但这身衣服穿起来还是挺难为情的。光是站在这里就显得很格格不入了……」", "plain_idx": 234, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0448", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "毕竟这衣服就是用来引人注目的，难免会显得格格不入，而且还会白白激起男人的兴趣……", "text_idx": 236, "plain": "毕竟这衣服就是用来引人注目的，难免会显得格格不入，而且还会白白激起男人的兴趣……", "plain_idx": 236, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "更何况穿着这身衣服的是天羽学姐。", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在熟悉学姐在学校里那温和的样子后，这外观上的反差感就会显得更大。", "text_idx": 238, "plain": "在熟悉学姐在学校里那温和的样子后，这外观上的反差感就会显得更大。", "plain_idx": 238, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「休息日做兼职很辛苦吧」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真想快点结束，然后赶快去活动室啊～」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0449", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "做完兼职还要去照顾动物吗。", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果不是真心喜欢，是做不到这个地步的。", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥，你也要帮忙？」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1062", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「算了，我一个男的也帮不上什么」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可以吸引女性顾客」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk1063", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「虽然偶尔也会有女孩子出入，但这毕竟是女仆咖啡厅啊」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": "「虽然偶尔也会有女孩子出入，但这毕竟是女仆咖啡厅啊」", "plain_idx": 249, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生去过女仆咖啡厅吗？」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0450", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没去过。我不太适应那种店」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯哼，我就知道」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0451", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸？」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也觉得你应该不是那种性格的人」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0452", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她是这样看待我的么。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过隼太应该挺喜欢这种店的。", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……抱歉。我不小心聊得太入迷了」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0453", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不会。我们才是打扰到你做兼职了」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，和你们聊天很愉快」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0454", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然这里不是学校，穿的也不是校服，但她的笑容却依旧美丽。", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route01_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的笑容才是真正无法买到的东西。", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
